      "issue": "The glance bullet tells the reader that research accepts `--claude-config-dir`, but that flag is internal to `dispatch-iteration.cjs` and is rendered by the workflow only when `config.executor.configDir` is set. The operator-facing surface is `--config-dir=PATH` on the `--executor` group (`.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-presentation.txt`:120), and `/deep:research`'s published flag table has no `--claude-config-dir` row, so a reader who types the named flag binds nothing. The entry's own Upgrade line already points at the config key, so only the glance bullet misnames the surface.",
